TB-mBJ Static Run — Pre-submission checklist
=============================================

Before submitting this calculation:

1. Copy CHGCAR from the PBE relaxation:
       cp /Users/jaelee/Desktop/repo/batterymat/batterymat/screening_cathode/dft_inputs/JVASP-117295/2_pbe_relax_delithiated/CHGCAR /Users/jaelee/Desktop/repo/batterymat/batterymat/screening_cathode/dft_inputs/JVASP-117295/4_tmbj_static_delithiated/CHGCAR

2. Replace POSCAR with the relaxed geometry:
       cp /Users/jaelee/Desktop/repo/batterymat/batterymat/screening_cathode/dft_inputs/JVASP-117295/2_pbe_relax_delithiated/CONTCAR /Users/jaelee/Desktop/repo/batterymat/batterymat/screening_cathode/dft_inputs/JVASP-117295/4_tmbj_static_delithiated/POSCAR

3. The INCAR already includes ICHARG = 11 to read the CHGCAR.

Reference: Li BCC metal energy for voltage calculation ~ -1.90 eV/atom
(PBE, Li_sv PAW, ENCUT=520, consistent with Materials Project).
